### ============================================
### MENU SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/menu-categories

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/menu-categories

@id = 1

### Create a new menu category
### Request Body: MenuCategoryDto
### Response: Created MenuCategoryDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1,
  "name": "Lunch Specials",
  "description": "Special menu for lunch hours"
}


### Get menu category by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: MenuCategoryDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{{id}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all menu categories for a branch
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<MenuCategoryDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/branch/{branchId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update menu category by ID
### Request Body: MenuCategoryDto
### Response: Updated MenuCategoryDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete menu category by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json